Package: fleetluma-agent
Version: 0.1.0~rc1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FleetLuma Developers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: FleetLuma host metric monitoring agent (developer candidate)
 FleetLuma reports CPU, RAM, disk and process metrics to the authorized
 FleetLuma HTTPS coordinator after explicit dashboard device pairing.
 This candidate must undergo clean-machine end-to-end acceptance before release.
